RPN assignments: 0, -2, 1, -1; colliding SSD assignments: 0, 1, -1, -1. Checked 36 anchors and 1000 Float64 coding round trips; maximum coordinate error 0.000000000000.
\image(figures/nms_matching_assignment.svg)
// result_end
\caption(RPN matching distinguishes positive, ignored and negative anchors. Identical SSD targets initially prefer the same anchor; distinct greedy matching assigns the second one to anchor 1.)
